@startuml 019-live-feed-class
title 019 live-feed：類別圖

class "FeedEvent" as Event {
  +key : string
  +text : string
}
class "LiveFeed" as Feed {
  +feedEvents(prev, next) : FeedEvent[]
  +useLiveFeed(view)
  -prev : useRef<TeacherView | null>
}
class "TeacherView" as View {
  +phase : Phase
  +mode? : ModeInfo
  +board : QuestionResult[]
}
class "Teacher" as Teacher {
  +useLiveView(query)
}
Feed ..> View : 比對前後兩次
Feed "1" o-- "0..*" Event : 產生
Teacher ..> Feed : useLiveView 後呼叫
@enduml
